 "remarks": "Lovingly cared for Cape set on a level third of an acre in sought after Belltown. The main floor consists of a LR, Formal DR, Kitchen, 2 BDs and full bath. Also on the main level is the heart of the home - a large Great Room with a soaring cathedral ceiling - great for entertaining and family gatherings. The Kitchen features SS appliances and steps out to a patio overlooking the in-ground pool, pool shed/dressing room, and mature landscaping & sprinkler system. A backyard retreat ready for your personal touches. There is a full height attic which offers potential to add additional bedrooms to expand the living space. Finished lower level with built in bar, full bath with tub and shower and laundry with bilko doors to the backyard. Conveniently located near parks, shopping, and just a 10 minute drive to train to NYC & I-95. A rare opportunity to make this well-loved home your own. Subject to probate approval.",
